sequenceDiagram
    participant A as ansible-playbook (oob-mgmt-server)
    participant P as httpapi plugin nvidia.nvue.httpapi
    participant N as NVUE REST API :8765 on a leaf
    A->>P: task nvidia.nvue.api operation set, data
    P->>N: POST /nvue_v1/revision
    P->>N: PATCH /nvue_v1/?rev=N (data)
    P->>N: PATCH /nvue_v1/revision/N state apply
    N-->>P: state applied
    P-->>A: changed true or false